{"id":766,"name":"passimian","speciesId":766,"dex":766,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["fighting"],"stats":{"hp":100,"attack":120,"defense":90,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":60,"speed":80},"abilities":[{"name":"receiver","hidden":false},{"name":"defiant","hidden":true}],"height":20,"weight":828,"baseExp":172,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/766.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/766.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/766.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/766.ogg","genus":"Teamwork Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon de trabalho em equipe","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"They form groups of roughly 20 individuals. Their mutual bond is remarkable—they will never let down a comrade."},{"version":"moon","text":"They battle with hard berries for weapons. Their techniques are passed from the boss to the group, generation upon generation."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"They use their saliva to stick leaves to their shoulders. You can tell what troop they belong to from the position of the leaves."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Berries are its weapons as well as the staple of its diet. The one that can throw a berry the farthest is the boss of the troop."},{"version":"sword","text":"Displaying amazing teamwork, they follow the orders of their boss as they all help out in the search for their favorite berries."},{"version":"shield","text":"Passimian live in groups of about 20, with each member performing an assigned role. Through cooperation, the group survives."}],"flavorPt":"Passimian vive em grupos de cerca de 20 pessoas, com cada membro desempenhando uma função atribuída. Através da cooperação, o grupo sobrevive.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isM